
Algorithm: Ant Colony Optimization (ACO) for the MCGP problem.
  Each iteration, a colony of ants constructs independent solutions
  guided by a pheromone matrix. Each solution is refined by
  Local Search and Tabu Search before pheromone update.
  The global best solution is tracked continuously and saved to disk.

Run configuration:
  Termination criteria : time = 60
  Max iterations       : 10000
  Log frequency        : every 10 iteration(s)
  Output directory     : results/logs

